{
  "name": "dsh-plugin-wechat-session",
  "version": "1.9.0",
  "description": "微信会话互通聚合包：装这一个包就同时带上桌面提醒与 @xmanrui/dsh-im 微信机器人。多条会话并行时逐条监督，需要手动选择 / 需要确认权限 / 任务跑完都会在 DSH 窗口右下角弹唯一一张带具体内容、点一下可跳到对应会话的应用内浮层卡片并响提示音（不依赖系统通知权限）；两类事件各有独立超时（需选择 / 确认默认 60 秒、任务跑完默认 30 秒），超时没切过去看 / 没把待办处理掉，就发一条富格式微信卡片留底（任务完成 / 需要选择 / 授予权限三类，带会话 ID 与 /session 切换命令）。v1.9.0 功能融合：取消独立的「全会话实时推送」开关，把富格式卡（原有经过充分验证的实时推送 6 段模板）直接融入超时发送——超时到点后逐条推送带会话标签与 /session 切换命令的富格式卡；多个 DSH 会话共用单一微信号、靠 /session <会话ID> 串行切换后继续聊，回答全文由 dsh-im 双向同步回投，实现在微信上实时交互。设置页「微信机器人 / 投递目标」「超时设置」两卡改为草稿 + 保存按钮（点保存才生效），lib 按钮样式对齐归档插件、明暗主题自适应。真回填 / 选项卡由 dsh-im 原生同步提问完成（会话绑定指引见 dsh-im 文档）。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "sweet560 <107355972+sweet560@users.noreply.github.com>",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "icon": "icon.svg",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/index.js",
    "lib/client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "icon.svg",
    "locale/en.json",
    "locale/zh.json",
    "README.md",
    "README.en.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "docs/RELEASE_NOTES_v1.5.0.md",
    "docs/RELEASE_NOTES_v1.6.0.md",
    "docs/RELEASE_NOTES_v1.7.0.md",
    "docs/RELEASE_NOTES_v1.8.0.md",
    "docs/RELEASE_NOTES_v1.9.0.md",
    "smoke/smoke-test.mjs"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "notification",
    "wechat",
    "dsh-im",
    "desktop-notification",
    "reminder",
    "approval",
    "session",
    "聚合包",
    "一次安装",
    "会话监督",
    "联动提醒",
    "桌面弹窗",
    "系统通知",
    "微信通知",
    "微信机器人",
    "提示音",
    "超时提醒"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=18"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node smoke/smoke-test.mjs",
    "pack": "npm pack --dry-run"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@xmanrui/dsh-im": "^5.10.0"
  },
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/sweet560/dsh-plugin-wechat-session.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/sweet560/dsh-plugin-wechat-session/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/sweet560/dsh-plugin-wechat-session#readme",
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-session",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-conversation"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    },
    "manifestVersion": 1
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale": ">=0.2.0-rc.1 <0.3.0-0"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale": {
      "optional": true
    }
  }
}
